&ldquo;I&rsquo;ve made the decision to end my relationship with Klay,&rdquo; Megan said in a statement obtained by Billboard . &ldquo;Trust, fidelity and respect are non-negotiable for me in a relationship, and when those values are compromised, there&rsquo;s no real path forward. I&rsquo;m taking this time to prioritize myself and move ahead with peace and clarity.&rdquo;

An Instagram Stories update, which is a temporary post, on Megan&rsquo;s account first addressed her breakup with the NBA player on Saturday.

&ldquo;Cheating, had me around your whole family playing house&hellip; got &lsquo;cold feet,'&rdquo; the block of text read. &ldquo;Holding you down through all your HORRIBLE mood swings and treatment towards me during your basketball season now you don&rsquo;t know if you can be &lsquo;monogamous&rsquo;????&rdquo;

She closed the post with &ldquo;b&mdash;- I need a REAL break after this one .. by yall.&rdquo;

The music artist, who&rsquo;s performing in Broadway&rsquo;s Moulin Rouge! through mid-May, and the Dallas Mavericks shooting guard&nbsp;started dating in summer 2025 &mdash; with Meg once recalling their first time connecting as &ldquo;a meet cute&rdquo; and once describing her former beau as &ldquo;the nicest person I&rsquo;ve ever met in my life.&rdquo; They had&nbsp; their red carpet debut &nbsp;in New York City that July.

By Thanksgiving, Thompson had named his boat after his girlfriend (&ldquo;SS Stallion&rdquo;), and the couple had spent a holiday together with Thompson&rsquo;s family.

In February 2026, Meg quipped that she was &ldquo;manifesting my engagement&rdquo; (presumably to Klay) in a video clip filmed in Milan with Olympic athletes Brittany Bowe and Hilary Knight, who are engaged.
